PHP (Hypertext Preprocessor)  :- 
     It is a server-side scripting language which is mainly  used for web development .
     It runs on a web server and is used to create dynamic web pages .


What does PHP means ?
    => Genaerates dynamic content (like user dashboards) .
    => Handles form data (login/signup) .
    => Intearcts with databases (MySQL , PostgreSQL etc) .